00:06:55.783 --> 00:06:57.720
And thank you for this question

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:01.080
because something I've become
incredibly passionate about

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.070
is mind-body disorders.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:03.980
And I know that sounds a little bit like

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.680
a fru-fru diagnosis.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:06.513
It's not.

00:07:06.513 --> 00:07:08.430
The mind and body are truly one.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.450
Communication happens both ways.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.290
So if you do something
that affects the body,

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.620
it also affects the mind.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.190
If you get injured or like
stab yourself in the leg

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.350
or get stabbed in the leg,

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:18.470
your heart rate goes up.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.320
If something is going on in your mind,

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:21.910
you're depressed, you're anxious,

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:23.290
your blood pressure also goes up.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.920
The mistake modern medicine makes

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.030
is that

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:30.980
there is an assumption
that all medical issues

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:33.670
come down to a physical problem,

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:35.230
a physical root cause.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.620
And that's not the case.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.740
In doing research

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:40.040
and in reading quality
books on the subject,

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.280
what I've found is

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:44.370
there are a ton of medical conditions

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.370
that are actually caused by
the mind-body connection,

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.780
instead of just the physical cause.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.610
That's why a big part of this
movement in modern medicine

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.320
is to seek out mindfulness,

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.010
because mindfulness doesn't just mean

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:56.500
being in touch with your breathing.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:57.780
Yes, that could be part of it.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.790
But also, it means being in touch

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.610
with your emotional side of things.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:05.230
Because emotions have an
impact on your physical body.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.480
That's been proven.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.200
There are a lot of patients that come in

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.670
wanting a physical diagnosis

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.410
or believing they have
a physical diagnosis,

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:14.610
